{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_11212630","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11212630","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1121263001:0":{"text":"이것 좀 봐! 왠지 여기에 뭐가 하나 부족한 것 같지 않아?","source_cn":"你们快看！我怎么觉得这个上面缺了一块东西？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFDCD11EB30D94F78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1121263002:0":{"text":"그러네. 누가 하나 빼간 것 같아.","source_cn":"的确，像是被撬走了一块。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C04499111758765","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121263003:0":{"text":"그런데 이 모양... 어딘가 낯이 익은걸.","source_cn":"话说这个缺损的形状……好像有些眼熟啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8076504DABA870B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1121263004:0":{"text":"아, 알겠다!","source_cn":"啊，我知道了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3D467DCC2A000E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1121263005:0":{"text":"알파 일레븐, 어서 네가 가진 그 물건을 꺼내 봐.","source_cn":"阿尔法十一，快把你身上那个东西拿出来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28F93FE54016999A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1121263006:1":{"t